# 证书链与吊销状态资源；保持证书验证可独立于代理连接工作

# Certum issuer and timestamping CA certificate repositories
# https://www.certum.eu/en/cert_expertise_root_certificates/
DOMAIN,repository.certum.pl
DOMAIN,subca.repository.certum.pl

# Sectigo issuer/root certificate downloads
# https://www.sectigo.com/knowledge-base/detail/Sectigo-Root-Certificates
DOMAIN,crt.sectigo.com

# Sectigo/USERTrust OCSP responders; public certificate status, not telemetry.
# https://www.sectigo.com/knowledge-base/detail/OCSP-and-CRL-access-information
DOMAIN,ocsp.usertrust.com
DOMAIN,ocsp.comodoca.com

# Let's Encrypt CRLs; exact observed hosts only
# https://letsencrypt.org/docs/lencr.org/
DOMAIN,x1.c.lencr.org
DOMAIN,yr.c.lencr.org
DOMAIN,e8.c.lencr.org
